        {%- elif ns2.consecutive_failures == 1 %}
            {{- '\n\n⚠️ SYSTEM WARNING: The previous tool call returned an error-shaped output. Short error-shaped outputs often indicate total failure; longer outputs may include partial success. Inspect the result and affected state, then decide whether this is an expected failure you are working through (a failing test or build mid-fix). If so, continue your normal fix cycle. Otherwise diagnose the cause, then retry with corrected arguments or a corrected approach.' }}
